%% Phase2 / post / G-02 发送文档消息
%% Helix owners: event/post.rs; port_reply/message_v3_post.rs; ws/handlers/post.rs; channel/write/post.rs
%% Client reference: cses-client helixTauriImGate.sendMessage(type=DOCUMENT)
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as PC Angular UI
  participant Gate as messageV3ImGate
  participant Native as Tauri/Native
  participant FFI as Mobile FFI
  participant Web as Browser/Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell/Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink/adapter

  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: sendMessage(type=DOCUMENT, document props)
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_send_message", minimal payload)
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Mobile FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_send_message", DOCUMENT payload)
  else Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_send_message", DOCUMENT payload)
  end
  E->>IM: step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: 校验 document.url/title/placeholder，生成 temporary_id
  IM->>Host: Effect::Persist(message type=DOCUMENT, status=sending)
  Host->>DB: BatchUpsert optimistic document row
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(P1, PersistOk)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(P1)
  E->>IM: release P1
  IM->>Sink: Emit im:post:sending(sendStatus=sending, document props)
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http POST /posts/create
  IM->>Host: Effect::ScheduleTimer send_timeout_ms
  Host->>Go: HTTP /posts/create(type=DOCUMENT)
  Go-->>Host: 2xx admission（不等于 sent）
  Go-->>WS: WS action=post(id,temp_id,event_seq,document props)
  WS->>E: Tick::Inbound(post)
  E->>IM: dispatch authority post
  IM->>Host: Persist temporary_id -> server id, sent
  IM->>Host: CancelTimer
  IM->>Host: PersistAtomic G-01(message + channel + member + cursor)
  Host->>DB: commit document row and channel absolute state
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply
  IM->>Host: Persist ScopedGet message/channel_member
  Host->>DB: readback document and viewer unread
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(readback)
  IM->>Sink: Emit im:post:received(document props, sendStatus=sent)
  IM->>Sink: Emit im:channel:update(lastPost=document, unreadCount)
  Sink-->>UI: im:__bus__ -> Angular document card
  Sink-->>FFI: batch raw document event bytes
  Sink-->>Web: EventBatch raw document event bytes
  alt HTTP/WS/Persist failure
    IM->>Host: Persist send_status=unsend
    IM->>Sink: Emit im:post:send-failed(sendStatus=failed)
  end
  Note over UI,Web: sender/receiver 读到同一 server id 与 document props；consumer runtime 仍需独立验证。
